      "message": "**Help Flag Triggers Application Failure** In `cli_options.cc`, explicitly requesting help returns `std::nullopt`, which cascades up to `main()` and results in an `EXIT_FAILURE` (1).\n\n* **Suggestion:** Add an explicit exit code state to `AppConfig` or throw a distinct expected value to ensure that invoking `--help` exits gracefully with `EXIT_SUCCESS` (0).",
